# Gwen Stacy // Ghost-Spider. Turn 1: Gwen enters and exiles the top card (an Island), which Bot1 may play for as long as it
# controls her. Turn 3: Bot1 transforms her into Ghost-Spider (4/4 flying, vigilance, haste) - the same permanent, so the
# permission stays (CR 701.27f). Turn 5: Bot1 plays that Island from exile (a land played from exile: +1/+1 counter), puts
# a second +1/+1 counter on Ghost-Spider with Revitalizing Repast, then removes both counters (the cost) to exile the top card
# of its library (Mox Emerald) and casts it from exile this turn (a spell from exile: one more counter). It ends with one
# counter, a 5/5, and Mox Emerald on the battlefield.

